WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.690
I'm Taniyama Mai,

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.020
1st-Year high-schooler.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.690
I have a job as a Ghost Hunter.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.360
Figuring out that the doll,
Minnie, was the culprit

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.030
behind the poltergeisting
is fine and all,

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.370
but ever since, Minnie has started
to take revenge, and things are tough.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.880
Upon looking up the owners
before the Morishita family,

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.880
we learned that children around 8 years
old died here, one after the next.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:34.050
Thinking that the children's
ghosts became sitebound spirits,

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:39.390
and were possessing Minnie,
Naru called in John and Masako.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.140
And then...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.390
Try driving the spirits out.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:47.730
However, when Monk started
his exorcism...

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.740
Tomiko... Tomiko...

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:55.070
My child...

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:58.070
What is that image?

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:01.750
For that matter,
who exactly is this Tomiko?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.010
Naumaku san manda bazaradan

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.850
Sendamakaro shata sowataya
un tarata, kan man

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.190
Naumaku san manda bodaran, on boron

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.850
Behind you, Monk!

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.520
Hey, there's nothing there.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:57.190
You can't see it, huh?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.530
Stop, Mai!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:06.870
Monk!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.870
You fool! Stay back!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.210
She's not there!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.210
But she showed up on the camera!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.550
Don't just stand there
babbling, get out!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.510
You too, Monk! Hurry and get out!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.550
I won't let anyone interfere.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.230
Mai!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.900
Naumaku san manda bazaradan kan!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.570
Are you okay?

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.570
Mm-hmm...

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.190
We're getting out of here.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.590
These are the remains of a well that
had been buried. It's pretty old.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:58.920
There is the spirit of a woman here.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:02.930
Lurking deep inside,
calling to the spirit of children,

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.600
pretending to be their mother.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.850
The children want to return home,

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.940
but they are lost,
and cannot get out.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:14.270
Then, Minnie is here, too?

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:19.280
Minnie- Tachibana Yukiko-san
is the leader of the children,

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:22.280
but the truth is,
she is anguished and sad,

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.820
and says that she can't
stand this anymore.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:43.970
It looks to me like this well continues
down into the bowels of the earth.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.970
The children's spirits have settled
all the way down at the bottom.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.640
Who is this "Tomiko"?

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.640
The woman's child.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.310
The woman is looking for her child.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:56.310
For her own daughter.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.440
That is why she
is gathering the children.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.610
So that's what's going on.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:04.990
Naru?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.320
I'm stepping out.
Take care of things.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.660
H-hold on, Naru!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:15.000
Geez! Take care of things?
I don't know what that means!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.670
What is he telling us to do!?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.670
He's as have-it-his-own-way as always.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.670
Should we drive the spirits
out until Naru gets back?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.890
Good idea. This time,
the two of you are up.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.600
Which one of you
is up to the challenge?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.060
I'm warning you, it's intense.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.060
Fine, I'll do it!

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:40.020
Monk and John,
you stay with Ayami-chan.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.360
- Right.
- Okay.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:48.070
May the heart of this house be
cleansed as thy interim dwelling place,

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.030
that thou may enshrine thyself here...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.370
Lousy Ayako...
"I'm scared. Stay with me."

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.040
And she calls herself a spiritualist?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.840
I just felt a chill.
Where on earth did it come from?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.050
May the kami of this world,

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:11.720
and Empress Oyamatomeko Sumera,
ruler of the Eight Islands-

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.400
Ayako, keep going!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.240
I know!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.070
Ayako!?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.080
Someone just touched me!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.950
Keep it together!
You're the priestess, right!?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.410
M-Mai?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.420
M-my foot...

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.090
Ayako!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.420
Mai!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.550
Help me!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.090
Mai!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:51.760
Taniyama-san!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.930
Lin-san!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.430
Taniyama-san!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.400
Mai!!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.460
Where am I?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.150
That's not Ayami-chan.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.820
I wonder whose child that is.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.820
No... Not that man...

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:59.160
I don't know why I know, but
you can't go off with that man!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:07:59.910
Wait!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.830
No!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.500
Tomiko!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.170
Tomiko! Tomiko!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.170
Is that the girl's mother?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.920
Tomiko!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:17.310
Tomiko!!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.200
No, don't-

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.870
Naru?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.160
Tomiko...

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.340
D-don't do it!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:53.880
Mai...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.550
Mai!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.890
Ayako...

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.310
Thank goodness, you've come to.

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.890
Lin is coming to help you, right now.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.480
That's right, I fell into the well...

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:08.900
Huh?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.230
A kidnapping?

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.570
I think so.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:17.570
The girl was probably kidnapped
by that man, and never came back.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.240
So then, she threw herself
down the well.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:27.580
You're not even a spiritualist.
What meaning could your dream have?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.250
Ow!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.920
No, surprisingly enough,
she may have hit the mark.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.930
Huh? You think so?

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.260
I don't know if it's
true or false, though.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:46.600
You know, it did seem
like a meaningful dream...

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.570
Naru?

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.620
This is the same old dream.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:08.580
Say, Naru, will we be able
to help Ayami-chan?

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.630
She'll be fine.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.630
Really?

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:17.630
You're right.
We just have to do our best.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.140
Are you sure everything's
all right, Naru-chan?

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.310
I-it's really him!?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.980
Lin, play back everything
you've got up to now.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.320
Right.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.650
Naru, you're back?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.990
I'm right here, aren't I?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.660
No doubt about it, it's really him.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.450
Huh?

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:42.990
'Sup.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.000
What do you mean, "'sup"?
What are you doing here?

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.660
You're supposed to be with
Ayami-chan, aren't you?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.000
Naru said she was fine.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.340
So we came back.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.670
Are you sure she's okay?

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.670
She's fine.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.340
This will all be settled tonight.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.350
Hara-san, what are they up to?

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:18.030
They're in the living room.
They haven't yet gone to the hotel.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.700
Matsuzaki-san,

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.490
please make some charms that
will block spirits from passing.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.740
The rest of you, post them
up throughout the house.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.040
We're going to raise
a kekkai barrier inside.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.040
What are you planning to do?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.380
We're going to get that woman
to take Tomiko back.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.380
But Tomiko-chan was...

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:39.720
Bringing Tomiko herself back
is impossible, of course.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:44.390
But until we get Tomiko back,
the woman will not be placated.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.010
Which is why...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.020
You don't mean Ayami-chan!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.060
The woman is the problem.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.820
There's no meaning unless we
can draw the woman out of here.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:03.410
She's no small-time spirit!
Mai got dragged down into the well!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:06.830
Shouldn't we be thinking
about our own safety?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:10.080
You can't mean you're going
to abandon Ayami-chan!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.760
Guys...

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.760
To think that with this many
of you here, you'd act like this.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:31.100
If that's the level of spiritualists
you all are, I don't need you.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.940
If we botch this, we could be turned
into sitebound spirits ourselves!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.570
It's up to you whether
or not you believe.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.580
Mai, if you want to leave too,
feel free.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.540
Naru...

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:01.460
Your chief is a real
piece of work, huh?

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:05.470
If Naru is willing to go that far,
then there's a chance of success.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:08.470
H-how can Masako be so sure of that!?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:12.140
Masako-chan, if you say so,
then I'll believe in Naru.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.480
Monk...

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.150
Heh, it's better than
doing nothing, right?

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:19.820
I think so, too.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.490
If you guys get yourselves pummeled,
I guess I can pick up your bones.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.450
Oh, Ayako...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:32.160
So, like Naru told us to, we put
up charms throughout the house.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:43.840
Say, what's the purpose
of pasting up all these charms?

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.840
Well, it's to-

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.510
To keep them from leaving this house.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.840
Naru!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:53.850
However, we will leave the demongate
open, and scatter the spirits.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.520
Whatever. How can you act
like such a bigshot?

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.860
- Because he's Naru.
- Because he's Naru.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.190
Never mind that,
what is the "demongate"?

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.530
The demongate is
the northeast direction.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.860
It's the direction that's easiest
for evil spirits to pass through.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.320
Monk, you and Matsuzaki-san

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:15.200
wait at the demongate, and when
the spirits appear, scatter them.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.210
You're going to temporarily
reduce the number of spirits,

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.540
and then draw the woman out, are you?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.550
John, you come to the living room,
and see if you can scatter the spirits.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.880
Right.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:27.880
Hey now, who's going to do
the all-important exorcism?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.390
- You don't mean...
- You don't mean...

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.370
Our Father, which art in Heaven,

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.250
hallowed be thy name.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:03.920
Masako?

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.590
Purifications are addressed
to the spirit,

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.260
to break their hold to this world.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.600
However, this is something
that only a medium can do.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:19.270
Naru is not a medium.
He intends to perform an exorcism.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.270
What's the difference between
an exorcism and a purification?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:25.940
Purification involves persuasion,
and changing a spirit's ways.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:29.610
Exorcism means to kill them by force.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.610
Kill them?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.490
I wish he wouldn't exorcise her.

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:38.620
At least, not right before my eyes.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:43.580
Sure... To Masako, spirits
and people would look alike.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.300
Mai!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.970
I-I'm all right.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.300
Someone pulled my arm...

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.640
In the beginning was the Word,

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.980
and the Word was with God...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.310
Hara-san, how about it?

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:09.650
They are trying to escape.
There are a lot fewer of them.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:13.990
They are fleeing out of
the living room, while crying.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.660
Say, can't you purify
the children's spirits?

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.330
That's impossible,
as long as the woman is here.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.000
Masako?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.510
S-she's coming out!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.490
Tomiko...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.700
Tomiko...

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.710
What eyes she has...

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.710
Tomiko-san is not here!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.710
Those children are not Tomiko-san.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.380
Please, set them free, already!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:13.840
They all want to go back
to their real mothers!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:15.380
Please!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.440
John!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.740
Naru, please don't!
Wait a minute!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.950
Naru!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.750
Your child is right here.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.420
What is that?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.380
Take all of the children you
have gathered here away with you.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.800
What a warm...

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.130
...tender light.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.130
Mai, look.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.150
She's gone. She's been purified.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:09.830
And so, the case was resolved.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.170
Thank you so very much.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:21.590
My brother says he'll return
as soon as he can.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.510
Really? Terrific.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:28.180
But, um... are you sure
everything is all right now?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.140
You should have no worries.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.190
Breakdown complete.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.860
By the way, what was that board?

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:38.190
A hitogata.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.200
A hitogata?

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.200
They're the archetype for
straw effigy curse dolls.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.530
You cut a human shape out
of a plank of paulownia wood,

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.540
and pattern it after
the person you want to curse.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.540
But isn't that the way you
put a curse on someone?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.880
Spellcasting always has both
a light and a dark side.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.550
Light helps others,
while dark does them harm.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.880
The same casting often has both
light and dark combined.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.890
Yep. In esoteric Buddhism, the methods
of confounding one's enemies

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.220
can be used in either sense, as well.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:10.560
The hitogata is a vessel that
the spirit enters.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.310
For example, if I were
to pattern a hitogata after Mai,

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:14.230
"Taniyama Mai"
For example, if I were
to pattern a hitogata after Mai,

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:17.730
"Taniyama Mai"
if I were to do harm to the hitogata,
Mai would be harmed, as well.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.280
"Taniyama Mai"

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.240
That's how close they come
to being the real thing.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.910
Then, that was...

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.580
Patterned after Tomiko.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:29.910
And so, since she thought she
had gotten Tomiko-chan back,

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.250
and her wish had been fulfilled,
she was purified.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:36.590
I have to say, I'm impressed
you could make a hitogata.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.590
That's the reason why you left?

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:43.930
Tomiko's birth and death dates were
necessary to make the hitogata.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:48.600
The woman was Oshima Hiro.
Tomiko was her only daughter.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.600
Tomiko disappeared one day,
and half a year later,

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.940
her body floated up out of the pond.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.270
Later, Oshima Hiro's house
was torn down,

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.940
and this house was built afterward.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.610
Had Tomiko been kidnapped?

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:07.320
Is that why the woman threw
herself down the well?

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.990
I don't know about that,

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:14.290
but there are no more
spirits in this house.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:20.250
Naru, by any chance, were you planning
a purification from the start?

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:27.640
Who would have thought that
Naru was a yin-yang master?

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.300
Yin-yang master?

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.640
You mean like Abe what's-his-name?

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.310
A high-level trick like
fashioning a hitogata of Tomiko

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:38.310
and performing a purification could
only be done by a yin-yang master.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.940
Amazing, isn't it?
I mean, a yin-yang master.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.650
Is that amazing?

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.650
It is kind of cool.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.660
Mai-chan...

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.990
Ayami-chan!

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:52.660
Mai-chan, will you come over again?

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:59.330
Ayami-chan, if you call me,
I'll come right away.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:00.670
Promise?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.000
Mm-hmm.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:06.340
In any case, I'm so glad that
Ayami-chan is safe.

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:49.440
Next time: File 3:
"The After School Hexer" #1
